n't do coincidences. When the same thing happens everywhere at once. The story being reported is usually not the story that's actually happening.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.28, "text": " That's six different countries, all feeling the same pain in the same week.", "tokens": [50364, 663, 311, 2309, 819, 3517, 11, 439, 2633, 264, 912, 1822, 294, 264, 912, 1243, 13, 50538], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18035059763972922, "compression_ratio": 1.6058631921824105, "no_speech_prob": 0.02493959665298462, "words": [{"word": " That's", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.28, "probability": 0.7629937827587128}, {"word": " six", "start": 0.28, "end": 0.44, "probability": 0.6578606963157654}, {"word": " different", "start": 0.44, "end": 0.74, "probability": 0.9967233538627625}, {"word": " countries,", "start": 0.74, "end": 1.16, "probability": 0.9893380403518677}, {"word": " all", "start": 1.44, "end": 1.6, "probability": 0.988965630531311}, {"word": " feeling", "start": 1.6, "end": 1.86, "probability": 0.9616509079933167}, {"word": " the", "start": 1.86, "end": 2.04, "probability": 0.9971328973770142}, {"word": " same", "start": 2.04, "end": 2.26, "probability": 0.9986315369606018}, {"word": " pain", "start": 2.26, "end": 2.52, "probability": 0.9916503429412842}, {"word": " in", "start": 2.52, "end": 2.66, "probability": 0.956288754940033}, {"word": " the", "start": 2.66, "end": 2.76, "probability": 0.9927706122398376}, {"word": " same", "start": 2.76, "end": 2.98, "probability": 0.9952977299690247}, {"word": " week.", "start": 2.98, "end": 3.28, "probability": 0.9458780288696289}]}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 3.54, "end": 5.82, "text": " Some point, the coincidence stops being a coincidence.", "tokens": [50538, 2188, 935, 11, 264, 22137, 10094, 885, 257, 22137, 13, 50676], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.18035059763972922, "compression_ratio": 1.6058631921824105, "no_speech_prob": 0.02493959665298462, "words": [{"word": " Some", "start": 3.